  "claim": "Arthur White (born 1933) is an English stage and screen actor, best known for his occasional role as police archivist Rodney in the crime drama \"A Touch of Frost\", alongside his real-life younger brother. Arthur's brother is best known for his portrayal of Derek \"Del Boy\" Trotter, in the British television series written by John Sullivan.",
